
Cameo — any AMD card → a working LLM box.

  cameo gpu-status     GPU tier (1 / 2 / 3)
  cameo-hello          console URL + key again
  cameo --help         everything else

  After login, open the URL cameo-hello printed. On this LAN:
  Start qwen2.5-0.5b and chat. That starter is a smoke test.

  Network is later: extra models (cameo pull), or this box as a
  fleet node (Ethernet, or iwctl on that node only).

Still on the live USB? Install to disk (offline, copies the image):
  cameo-install-guided    installer — account, disk, type name to confirm
  cameo-install           dry run — plan only, changes nothing
  After install: reboot first. Unplug the USB when the screen goes dark.

  https://cameoconstruct.xyz   https://github.com/sadlowskik/Cameo
